vtmake — fast vector tiles
==========================

vtmake is a reimplementation of tippecanoe in Rust. It makes the same tiles as
tippecanoe v2.82.0, at higher speed. Most of its tiling
logic is a port of tippecanoe's C++ code, and it includes code from other open
source projects. We thank their authors. Their licences require these notices,
and we keep them gladly.

